  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture Finance Support Facility (AFSF) Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The overall objective of the project is to demonstrate to a broad set  of stakeholderscomma particularly commercial bankscomma specialized financial  organizationscomma development finance organizationscomma and insurance  companiescomma that it is possible to profitably provide financial  services to smallholder farmers and other low income clientele located  in rural areas.
 
 This GPP is designed to support the replication or scaling-up of  profitable rural finance business models and the generation of  knowledge and learning about these models. It will provide grants to  commercial bankscomma specialized financial organizationscomma such as leasing  companiescomma development finance organizationscomma financial cooperative  networkscomma insurance companiescomma and to a limited extentcomma asset  registriescomma credit bureauscomma and training organizations.  It will  support activities that seek to increase access to financial services  in rural areas. It will  fund grantee conferencescomma study tours for  grantee and World Bank Group staffcomma a quarterly rural finance seminar  seriescomma and publication of rural finance case studies.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
